<title>JAPAN: KDD shares retreat in mid-afternoon trade.</title>
<headline>KDD shares retreat in mid-afternoon trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Kokusai Denshin Denwa Co Ltd (KDD) retreated in mid-afternoon Wednesday trade, as investors sold issues which have a cloudy outlook and replaced them with firms that have rosier prospects, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0431 GMT, the shares were down 520 yen at 7,300 yen, the fifth largest percentage loser on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Brokers said KDD's planned international rate cuts could impact on its future earnings.</p>
